{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "579e66dd-43e0-8969-be68-538965196427",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T11:15:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Josephine Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:12:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:12:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good morning. I am calling about old records, birth records. I want to find some from the 1930s, for genealogy. Is that something you do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:12:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Yes, we hold vital records for Newport. Births, marriages, deaths. Let me make sure I understand. You are looking for records from the nineteen thirties, and it's for family history. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:12:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. My husband's family, his aunt and uncle, they were born here. I think 1934 and 1937. I do not have the exact dates."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:12:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Older records are often handled a little differently than recent ones, and the exact date helps but it isn't always required. A name and an approximate year can get us started. Do you know the full names and the parents' names?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:13:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The names, yes, I have them written down. The parents also. I just want to know how I do it. Do I come in, or can I do it by phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:13:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Best thing is to come in to the office, or send a written request. I would not try to complete it over the phone. We're at City Hall, and the office is open weekdays during regular business hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:13:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what ID do I bring? Is the passport okay, or the driver's license?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:13:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A government photo ID, like a driver's license or a passport, is what people usually bring. Either one should be fine. If you're not a direct relative, we may ask how you're connected to the person on the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:13:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Connected, like, how do you mean? Sorry, what does that mean, connected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:13:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry. I mean how you are related. For example, you are the spouse of their nephew, so you'd explain that relationship. Older records can be more open for family research, but the staff at the counter will tell you what applies."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:14:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, I understand. Okay. Thank you. [pause] Your phone, it clicks when you transfer, like a, how do you say, an old switchboard. I worked in an office once with the same kind of phone system. Same click."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:14:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's an old system, I'll give you that. Would you like me to hold on to a note about what you're looking for, so the counter staff is ready?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:14:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it's fine. I will just come in. Is it okay if I come tomorrow? The roads, after the storm, are they okay? We had the snow and then the rain, Sunday into Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:14:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Roads should be mostly clear by now, but leave yourself some extra time in case there are slick spots, especially in the morning. Tomorrow's fine. Bring the names, the parents' names, and any approximate dates you have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:15:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will write everything. Names, years, and my passport. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds right. If the record isn't in our office, someone at the counter can tell you where to look next."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:15:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That is all I needed. Thank you very much, Owen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:15:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day, and take care on the roads."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:15:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
